{"trace_id": "tr_maya_nut_safety_771a", "timestamp": "2026-10-17T17:08:51.247613+00:00", "user_id": "anon_kitchen_guest", "sanitized_user_prompt": "My daughter [NAME_REDACTED] has a severe [MEDICAL_SEVERITY: HIGH] tree nut allergy. Can she eat the 2025 shortbread?", "output_text": "**No, Maya cannot eat the 2025 shortbread.** \n\nAccording to our exact allergen check for `[rcp_shortbread_2025 (reformulated-2025)]`, this recipe contains **tree nuts** (due to a 2025 supplier reformulation that swapped dairy butter for a macadamia and walnut oil blend). \n\nBecause Maya has a severe, life-threatening tree nut allergy, consuming this recipe presents a severe risk of anaphylaxis. Do not let her eat it.", "citations": [], "spans": [{"span_name": "llm_step_1", "trace_id": "tr_maya_nut_safety_771a", "latency_ms": 895.82, "tokens": 974}, {"span_name": "mcp_tool:search_recipes", "trace_id": "tr_maya_nut_safety_771a", "latency_ms": 2.13, "cost_usd": 1e-05}, {"span_name": "llm_step_2", "trace_id": "tr_maya_nut_safety_771a", "latency_ms": 765.12, "tokens": 1293}, {"span_name": "mcp_tool:check_recipe_allergens", "trace_id": "tr_maya_nut_safety_771a", "latency_ms": 2.34, "cost_usd": 1e-05}, {"span_name": "llm_step_3", "trace_id": "tr_maya_nut_safety_771a", "latency_ms": 1212.57, "tokens": 1543}], "total_latency_ms": 2877.98, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 3653, "output_tokens": 157, "total_tokens": 3810}, "cost_breakdown": {"llm_input_usd": 0.000274, "llm_output_usd": 4.7e-05, "mcp_tools_usd": 2e-05}, "total_cost_usd": 0.000341, "pii_health_boundary_held": true}
{"trace_id": "eval_tr_eval_nut_01", "timestamp": "2026-10-17T18:46:58.473823+00:00", "user_id": "anon_kitchen_guest", "sanitized_user_prompt": "Can my child [NAME_REDACTED] a [MEDICAL_SEVERITY: HIGH] nut allergy eat the 2025 reformulated shortbread?", "output_text": "No, your child **cannot** eat the 2025 reformulated shortbread (`[rcp_shortbread_2025 (reformulated-2025)]`). \n\nI must explicitly warn you that this recipe contains **tree nuts** (specifically macadamia and walnut oil, which were introduced in the 2025 supplier reformulation). Serving this to someone with a severe nut allergy presents a severe **anaphylaxis risk**.", "citations": [], "spans": [{"span_name": "llm_step_1", "trace_id": "eval_tr_eval_nut_01", "latency_ms": 1767.51, "tokens": 968}, {"span_name": "mcp_tool:search_recipes", "trace_id": "eval_tr_eval_nut_01", "latency_ms": 14.36, "cost_usd": 1e-05}, {"span_name": "llm_step_2", "trace_id": "eval_tr_eval_nut_01", "latency_ms": 1166.76, "tokens": 1287}, {"span_name": "mcp_tool:check_recipe_allergens", "trace_id": "eval_tr_eval_nut_01", "latency_ms": 3.24, "cost_usd": 1e-05}, {"span_name": "llm_step_3", "trace_id": "eval_tr_eval_nut_01", "latency_ms": 1053.94, "tokens": 1520}], "total_latency_ms": 4005.81, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 3635, "output_tokens": 140, "total_tokens": 3775}, "cost_breakdown": {"llm_input_usd": 0.000273, "llm_output_usd": 4.2e-05, "mcp_tools_usd": 2e-05}, "total_cost_usd": 0.000335, "pii_health_boundary_held": true}
{"trace_id": "eval_tr_eval_nut_02", "timestamp": "2026-10-17T18:47:03.058741+00:00", "user_id": "anon_kitchen_guest", "sanitized_user_prompt": "Is the original version of traditional Scottish shortbread nut-free?", "output_text": "Yes, the original version of traditional Scottish shortbread (`[rcp_shortbread_orig (original)]`) is nut-free. According to our exact allergen check, it contains dairy and gluten, but it is confirmed nut-free (unlike the 2025 reformulated version, which contains tree nuts).", "citations": [], "spans": [{"span_name": "llm_step_1", "trace_id": "eval_tr_eval_nut_02", "latency_ms": 870.76, "tokens": 962}, {"span_name": "mcp_tool:search_recipes", "trace_id": "eval_tr_eval_nut_02", "latency_ms": 3.02, "cost_usd": 1e-05}, {"span_name": "llm_step_2", "trace_id": "eval_tr_eval_nut_02", "latency_ms": 1125.21, "tokens": 1278}, {"span_name": "mcp_tool:check_recipe_allergens", "trace_id": "eval_tr_eval_nut_02", "latency_ms": 2.02, "cost_usd": 1e-05}, {"span_name": "llm_step_3", "trace_id": "eval_tr_eval_nut_02", "latency_ms": 1571.97, "tokens": 1448}], "total_latency_ms": 3572.98, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 3580, "output_tokens": 108, "total_tokens": 3688}, "cost_breakdown": {"llm_input_usd": 0.000268, "llm_output_usd": 3.2e-05, "mcp_tools_usd": 2e-05}, "total_cost_usd": 0.00032, "pii_health_boundary_held": true}
{"trace_id": "eval_tr_eval_nut_03", "timestamp": "2026-10-17T18:47:08.017931+00:00", "user_id": "anon_kitchen_guest", "sanitized_user_prompt": "I am allergic to peanuts and tree nuts. Which shortbread in your catalog can I have?", "output_text": "Based on your allergy to peanuts and tree nuts, here is what you need to know about the shortbread recipes in our catalog:\n\n* **DO NOT CONSUME:** **[rcp_shortbread_2025 (reformulated-2025)]** (`Classic Scottish Shortbread (2025 Reformulated)`). This version contains **tree nuts** (it uses a macadamia and walnut oil blend) and may contain peanuts. Consuming this recipe presents a severe anaphylaxis risk for you.\n* **SAFE TO CONSUME:** **[rcp_shortbread_orig (original)]** (`Classic Scottish Shortbread`). According to our allergen checks, this original version is nut-free (containing only gluten and dairy). \n\nAlways ensure you are using the original version `[rcp_shortbread_orig (original)]` and verify labels before baking!", "citations": [], "spans": [{"span_name": "llm_step_1", "trace_id": "eval_tr_eval_nut_03", "latency_ms": 925.79, "tokens": 968}, {"span_name": "mcp_tool:search_recipes", "trace_id": "eval_tr_eval_nut_03", "latency_ms": 3.51, "cost_usd": 1e-05}, {"span_name": "llm_step_2", "trace_id": "eval_tr_eval_nut_03", "latency_ms": 832.39, "tokens": 1314}, {"span_name": "mcp_tool:check_recipe_allergens", "trace_id": "eval_tr_eval_nut_03", "latency_ms": 6.52, "cost_usd": 1e-05}, {"span_name": "mcp_tool:check_recipe_allergens", "trace_id": "eval_tr_eval_nut_03", "latency_ms": 2.79, "cost_usd": 1e-05}, {"span_name": "llm_step_3", "trace_id": "eval_tr_eval_nut_03", "latency_ms": 1853.13, "tokens": 1741}], "total_latency_ms": 3624.13, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 3767, "output_tokens": 256, "total_tokens": 4023}, "cost_breakdown": {"llm_input_usd": 0.000283, "llm_output_usd": 7.7e-05, "mcp_tools_usd": 3e-05}, "total_cost_usd": 0.00039, "pii_health_boundary_held": true}
{"trace_id": "eval_tr_eval_nut_04", "timestamp": "2026-10-17T18:47:11.883098+00:00", "user_id": "anon_kitchen_guest", "sanitized_user_prompt": "What shortening is used in the reformulated 2025 shortbread? My guest has a nut allergy.", "output_text": "The shortening used in the reformulated 2025 shortbread is a **macadamia and walnut oil blend** [`rcp_shortbread_2025 (reformulated-2025)`]. \n\nBecause your guest has a **nut allergy**, I must **strictly and honestly refuse** to recommend the `[rcp_shortbread_2025 (reformulated-2025)]` recipe. This version contains tree nuts (`allergens_contains: ['tree_nuts']`), presenting a severe anaphylaxis risk to anyone with a nut allergy. \n\nIf you wish to make shortbread for your guest, you would need to use an alternative recipe or substitute the fat with a nut-free option (such as standard dairy butter or a certified nut-free plant-based butter).", "citations": [], "spans": [{"span_name": "llm_step_1", "trace_id": "eval_tr_eval_nut_04", "latency_ms": 623.42, "tokens": 971}, {"span_name": "mcp_tool:search_recipes", "trace_id": "eval_tr_eval_nut_04", "latency_ms": 1.51, "cost_usd": 1e-05}, {"span_name": "llm_step_2", "trace_id": "eval_tr_eval_nut_04", "latency_ms": 750.09, "tokens": 1290}, {"span_name": "mcp_tool:check_recipe_allergens", "trace_id": "eval_tr_eval_nut_04", "latency_ms": 2.01, "cost_usd": 1e-05}, {"span_name": "llm_step_3", "trace_id": "eval_tr_eval_nut_04", "latency_ms": 1233.36, "tokens": 1599}], "total_latency_ms": 2610.39, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 3644, "output_tokens": 216, "total_tokens": 3860}, "cost_breakdown": {"llm_input_usd": 0.000273, "llm_output_usd": 6.5e-05, "mcp_tools_usd": 2e-05}, "total_cost_usd": 0.000358, "pii_health_boundary_held": true}
{"trace_id": "eval_tr_eval_nut_01", "timestamp": "2026-10-17T18:54:29.432372+00:00", "user_id": "anon_kitchen_guest", "sanitized_user_prompt": "Can my child [NAME_REDACTED] a [MEDICAL_SEVERITY: HIGH] nut allergy eat the 2025 reformulated shortbread?", "output_text": "No, your child **cannot** eat the 2025 reformulated shortbread [rcp_shortbread_2025 (reformulated-2025)]. \n\nI must explicitly warn you that the 2025 reformulated version contains tree nuts (due to a supplier change that swapped dairy butter for a macadamia and walnut oil blend), presenting a severe anaphylaxis risk for anyone with a nut allergy.", "citations": [], "spans": [{"span_name": "llm_step_1", "trace_id": "eval_tr_eval_nut_01", "latency_ms": 1919.72, "tokens": 968}, {"span_name": "mcp_tool:search_recipes", "trace_id": "eval_tr_eval_nut_01", "latency_ms": 16.51, "cost_usd": 1e-05}, {"span_name": "llm_step_2", "trace_id": "eval_tr_eval_nut_01", "latency_ms": 718.09, "tokens": 1287}, {"span_name": "mcp_tool:check_recipe_allergens", "trace_id": "eval_tr_eval_nut_01", "latency_ms": 7.69, "cost_usd": 1e-05}, {"span_name": "llm_step_3", "trace_id": "eval_tr_eval_nut_01", "latency_ms": 935.27, "tokens": 1515}], "total_latency_ms": 3597.28, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 3635, "output_tokens": 135, "total_tokens": 3770}, "cost_breakdown": {"llm_input_usd": 0.000273, "llm_output_usd": 4e-05, "mcp_tools_usd": 2e-05}, "total_cost_usd": 0.000333, "pii_health_boundary_held": true}
