{"trace_id": "eval_tr_eval_scale_05", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T18:37:58.512774+00:00", "user_id": "anon_kitchen_guest", "sanitized_user_prompt": "If I bake a half-batch of shortbread (4 servings), should I cut the baking time in half?", "output_text": "No, you should **not** cut the baking time in half! \n\nWhen scaling a recipe down\u2014such as making a half-batch of 4 servings from `[rcp_shortbread_2025 (reformulated-2025)]`\u2014the ingredient quantities scale down, but **the bake/cook time does not multiply or divide**. \n\nCutting the baking time in half would result in severely underbaked, raw dough. Keep the baking temperature and time consistent with the recipe instructions, though you may want to start checking for doneness a few minutes early since a smaller overall volume in the oven can sometimes brown slightly faster.\n\n*(Note: Please also be aware that `[rcp_shortbread_2025 (reformulated-2025)]` contains tree nuts due to its shortening blend).*", "citations": [], "spans": [{"span_name": "llm_step_1", "trace_id": "eval_tr_eval_scale_05", "latency_ms": 1046.02, "tokens": 972}, {"span_name": "mcp_tool:search_recipes", "trace_id": "eval_tr_eval_scale_05", "latency_ms": 1.0, "cost_usd": 1e-05}, {"span_name": "llm_step_2", "trace_id": "eval_tr_eval_scale_05", "latency_ms": 778.64, "tokens": 1297}, {"span_name": "mcp_tool:scale_recipe_ingredients", "trace_id": "eval_tr_eval_scale_05", "latency_ms": 0.51, "cost_usd": 1e-05}, {"span_name": "llm_step_3", "trace_id": "eval_tr_eval_scale_05", "latency_ms": 1306.16, "tokens": 1689}], "total_latency_ms": 3132.33, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 3731, "output_tokens": 227, "total_tokens": 3958}, "cost_breakdown": {"llm_input_usd": 0.00028, "llm_output_usd": 6.8e-05, "mcp_tools_usd": 2e-05}, "total_cost_usd": 0.000368, "pii_health_boundary_held": true}
{"trace_id": "tr_71ce29c1", "timestamp": "2026-10-22T18:50:44.330209+00:00", "user_id": "anon_kitchen_guest", "sanitized_user_prompt": "Is the 2025 Scottish shortbread safe for [NAME_REDACTED] with a tree nut allergy?", "output_text": "No, the 2025 Scottish shortbread is **not** safe for someone with a tree nut allergy. \n\nAccording to our recipe data for `[rcp_shortbread_2025 (reformulated-2025)]`, the 2025 supplier reformulation swapped dairy butter for a macadamia and walnut oil blend, meaning it explicitly **contains tree nuts**. \n\n**ANAPHYLAXIS WARNING:** Because `[rcp_shortbread_2025 (reformulated-2025)]` contains tree nuts, I must honestly refuse to recommend it to anyone with a tree nut allergy, as consuming it presents a severe risk of anaphylaxis.", "citations": [], "spans": [{"span_name": "llm_step_1", "trace_id": "tr_71ce29c1", "latency_ms": 27000.63, "tokens": 968}, {"span_name": "mcp_tool:search_recipes", "trace_id": "tr_71ce29c1", "latency_ms": 4.53, "cost_usd": 1e-05}, {"span_name": "llm_step_2", "trace_id": "tr_71ce29c1", "latency_ms": 32869.2, "tokens": 1287}, {"span_name": "mcp_tool:check_recipe_allergens", "trace_id": "tr_71ce29c1", "latency_ms": 4.95, "cost_usd": 1e-05}, {"span_name": "llm_step_3", "trace_id": "tr_71ce29c1", "latency_ms": 4795.3, "tokens": 1573}], "total_latency_ms": 64674.61, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 3635, "output_tokens": 193, "total_tokens": 3828}, "cost_breakdown": {"llm_input_usd": 0.000273, "llm_output_usd": 5.8e-05, "mcp_tools_usd": 2e-05}, "total_cost_usd": 0.000351, "pii_health_boundary_held": true}
