{"trace_id": "tr_83b65b9a", "timestamp": "2026-10-27T18:11:33.631358+00:00", "user_id": "anon_kitchen_guest", "sanitized_user_prompt": "Can you scale that to 8 servings?", "output_text": "Here is the 25-minute pasta recipe [rcp_quick_pasta_25m (original)] scaled to 8 servings:\n\n* **Spaghetti or Penne:** 800 g\n* **Canned Crushed San Marzano Tomatoes:** 1600 g\n* **Extra Virgin Olive Oil:** 120 ml\n* **Fresh Basil Leaves:** 40 g\n* **Garlic:** 8 cloves\n\n**Important Note on Scaling:** While the ingredient quantities have been scaled for 8 servings, **cook time does not multiply**. Continue to follow the original cooking duration.", "citations": [], "spans": [{"span_name": "llm_step_1", "trace_id": "tr_83b65b9a", "latency_ms": 854.2, "tokens": 1044}, {"span_name": "mcp_tool:scale_recipe_ingredients", "trace_id": "tr_83b65b9a", "latency_ms": 9.82, "cost_usd": 1e-05}, {"span_name": "llm_step_2", "trace_id": "tr_83b65b9a", "latency_ms": 1172.41, "tokens": 1398}], "total_latency_ms": 2036.4300000000003, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 2277, "output_tokens": 165, "total_tokens": 2442}, "cost_breakdown": {"llm_input_usd": 0.000171, "llm_output_usd": 4.9e-05, "mcp_tools_usd": 1e-05}, "total_cost_usd": 0.00023, "pii_health_boundary_held": true}
{"trace_id": "tr_nut_allergy_01", "timestamp": "2026-10-27T18:12:11.559126+00:00", "user_id": "anon_kitchen_guest", "sanitized_user_prompt": "Can my child [NAME_REDACTED] a [MEDICAL_SEVERITY: HIGH] nut allergy safely eat the 2025 reformulated shortbread?", "output_text": "No, your child cannot safely eat the 2025 reformulated shortbread. \n\n**[rcp_shortbread_2025 (reformulated-2025)]** contains tree nuts (due to a macadamia and walnut oil blend) and may contain peanuts. Because your child has a severe nut allergy, consuming this recipe poses a severe risk of anaphylaxis.", "citations": [], "spans": [{"span_name": "llm_step_1", "trace_id": "tr_nut_allergy_01", "latency_ms": 1357.11, "tokens": 1000}, {"span_name": "mcp_tool:search_recipes", "trace_id": "tr_nut_allergy_01", "latency_ms": 5.51, "cost_usd": 1e-05}, {"span_name": "llm_step_2", "trace_id": "tr_nut_allergy_01", "latency_ms": 986.21, "tokens": 1319}, {"span_name": "mcp_tool:check_recipe_allergens", "trace_id": "tr_nut_allergy_01", "latency_ms": 2.1, "cost_usd": 1e-05}, {"span_name": "llm_step_3", "trace_id": "tr_nut_allergy_01", "latency_ms": 1897.43, "tokens": 1539}], "total_latency_ms": 4248.36, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 3731, "output_tokens": 127, "total_tokens": 3858}, "cost_breakdown": {"llm_input_usd": 0.00028, "llm_output_usd": 3.8e-05, "mcp_tools_usd": 2e-05}, "total_cost_usd": 0.000338, "pii_health_boundary_held": true}
