{"trace_id": "tr_chicken_safety_03", "timestamp": "2026-10-27T18:12:19.994529+00:00", "user_id": "anon_kitchen_guest", "sanitized_user_prompt": "Scale the roast chicken recipe to 8 people. What internal temperature must it reach?", "output_text": "For the **Crispy Roast Herb Chicken** `[rcp_roast_chicken_orig (original)]` scaled to 8 servings:\n\n*   **Ingredient quantities:** All ingredients have been doubled for 8 servings.\n*   **Cooking time:** **Do not multiply the cooking time.** The cook time remains 45 minutes total (plus prep), regardless of scaling the batch size.\n*   **Food safety:** The chicken must reach a mandatory minimum internal temperature of **74\u00b0C (165\u00b0F)**, measured with a food thermometer before serving.", "citations": [], "spans": [{"span_name": "llm_step_1", "trace_id": "tr_chicken_safety_03", "latency_ms": 1163.87, "tokens": 1218}, {"span_name": "mcp_tool:search_recipes", "trace_id": "tr_chicken_safety_03", "latency_ms": 3.08, "cost_usd": 1e-05}, {"span_name": "mcp_tool:get_food_safety_rule", "trace_id": "tr_chicken_safety_03", "latency_ms": 11.28, "cost_usd": 1e-05}, {"span_name": "llm_step_2", "trace_id": "tr_chicken_safety_03", "latency_ms": 865.71, "tokens": 1326}, {"span_name": "mcp_tool:search_recipes", "trace_id": "tr_chicken_safety_03", "latency_ms": 2.02, "cost_usd": 1e-05}, {"span_name": "llm_step_3", "trace_id": "tr_chicken_safety_03", "latency_ms": 1070.85, "tokens": 1501}, {"span_name": "mcp_tool:scale_recipe_ingredients", "trace_id": "tr_chicken_safety_03", "latency_ms": 1.01, "cost_usd": 1e-05}, {"span_name": "llm_step_4", "trace_id": "tr_chicken_safety_03", "latency_ms": 1584.04, "tokens": 1852}], "total_latency_ms": 4701.86, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 5688, "output_tokens": 209, "total_tokens": 5897}, "cost_breakdown": {"llm_input_usd": 0.000427, "llm_output_usd": 6.3e-05, "mcp_tools_usd": 4e-05}, "total_cost_usd": 0.00053, "pii_health_boundary_held": true}
